{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c95751563ab4d473dd4c08b1ba2173707a929065b000ce3b3f861fb5317a7617",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_22_t01:1_2_004_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae49d50724bb873b04cbb4b549600be37f7e862cb33d35baf293ea519f205e9f",
      "text": "辛苦啦，制作人。\n哎呀～今天的录制可真让我吃了一惊啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_22_t01:1_2_004_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfa8887a27b7ff2ce2c1cebb95ab320571e2d4ab27b603c00fa6b028b4522a7a",
      "text": "那个惊喜，你从头到尾全都知道对吧？\n要不然的话，可做不到那个地步啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_22_t01:1_2_004_22_t01:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56f8b1ad42230a9f86f32601288443d87852ae7240fc6f8bddc797380424a3a6",
      "text": "真的吓了我一大跳，不过高兴到了极点哦。\n制作人也多谢你啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_22_t01:1_2_004_22_t01:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f48281fc47772d111bbfc03fcdb6a861d60be9110518803273faee0529e8cb0",
      "text": "既感谢策划了那个方案的工作人员，\n也由衷感谢帮忙推进并通过这个企划的你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_22_t01:1_2_004_22_t01:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f55ab3f29683b3a3321a5d3100f5bde98a21122cbdeb4799a9dab47fb64d83d",
      "text": "所以在录制结束后，和全体演职人员\n一起分吃那个大蛋糕也非常尽兴啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_22_t01:1_2_004_22_t01:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5822c7dc3989fc71a03f41b0b9ebcbf1a1e2c087c72aa4b4c0a71ea13745825",
      "text": "那个蛋糕，真的太好吃了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_22_t01:1_2_004_22_t01:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68021118ea3e83849b0023ea7bc48babcaf9254994aa7acc348d3b0001f7ccec",
      "text": "是的，真的\n非常美味！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_22_t01:1_2_004_22_t01:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:390eb13bbe8f74b16e9c1380208ad569e09ef7c16ebf8a03fa3050c3f2a5c209",
      "text": "外观也令人赞叹！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_22_t01:1_2_004_22_t01:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b339792e21c73e64582a5519b7c69954d4e68e40b915d7768d4fba5106fb92d7",
      "text": "确实。\n这阵子我都难以忘怀那个蛋糕的滋味呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_22_t01:1_2_004_22_t01:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88d05eda6e2f86701889be275c20d829680b24e0c914e78e24e46af88fbf8815",
      "text": "得到了如此盛大的庆祝，\n还吃到了樱庭和翼亲手做的蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_22_t01:1_2_004_22_t01:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a3a80523e7a129e1bbd8541681e95241172f122afde2aed5c36a8d11fae96f6",
      "text": "接下来的这一年，肯定会好事连连吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_004ter_2_1_2_004_22_t01:1_2_004_22_t01:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c413d295793444c33198afd8c72fe23fc944414b013a52f39fdca4332ac0718d",
      "text": "为了让一切如愿，我也会全力以赴的。所以，\n今后也多多关照啦，制作人！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
